<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>注册 - LZJOJ</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/base.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/components.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/layout.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="nav-left"><%- navigation %></div>
        <div class="nav-right">
            <div class="login-content">
                <div id="login-area"></div>
                <div id="login-status">
                    <div class="status-indicator" id="statusIndicator"></div>
                    <span id="statusText">正在检测登录状态...</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="page">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>注册账号 - LZJOJ</h1>
            <div class="home-layout">
                <div class="left card">
                    <h2>🚀 欢迎注册 LZJOJ</h2>
                    <p>请填写以下信息以创建您的 LZJOJ 账号，加入我们一起探索编程的乐趣！</p>
                    <form class="register-form" id="register-form">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="username">用户名</label>
                            <input type="text" id="username" required>
                            <label for="password">密码</label>
                            <input type="password" id="password" required>
                            <label for="email">邮箱</label>
                            <input type="email" id="email" required>
                            <button type="button" class="btn" id="sendCodeButton">发送验证代码到邮箱</button>
                            <label for="code">验证代码</label>
                            <input type="text" id="code" required>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn">注册</button>
                    </form>
                </div>
                <div class="right card">
                    <h2>注册流程</h2>
                    <ol>
                        <li>填写注册表单，提供用户名、密码和邮箱</li>
                        <li>点击发送验证代码，系统会向您的邮箱发送验证码</li>
                        <li>填入验证码后点击注册</li>
                        <li>注册成功后，您可以立即登录并开始使用 LZJOJ 的各种功能</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script type="text/javascript" src="/assets/checklogin.min.js"></script>
    <script>
        let token = '';
        document.getElementById('sendCodeButton').addEventListener('click', async () => {
            const email = document.getElementById('email').value;
            const username = document.getElementById('username').value;
            const password = document.getElementById('password').value;
            if (!email || !username || !password) { alert('请先填写完整信息'); return; }
            const resp = await fetch(`/api/genregtoken?email=${encodeURIComponent(email)}&username=${encodeURIComponent(username)}&password=${encodeURIComponent(password)}`);
            const data = await resp.json();
            if (data.status === 'Y') {
                alert('验证代码已发送到您的邮箱');
                token = data.token;
            } else {
                alert('发送失败: ' + data.error);
            }
        });
        document.getElementById('register-form').addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            if (!token) { alert('请先发送验证代码'); return; }
            const code = document.getElementById('code').value;
            const resp = await fetch(`/api/verifycode?code=${encodeURIComponent(code)}&token=${encodeURIComponent(token)}`);
            const data = await resp.json();
            if (data.status === 'Y') {
                alert('注册成功！请登录');
                window.location.href = '/login';
            } else {
                alert('注册失败，请重试');
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
